{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridakeysventures/items/196883/", "pk": 196883, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridakeysventures/", "pk": 45475, "shortname": "floridakeysventures", "name": "Florida Keys Ventures", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Private Key West History And Culture Southernmost Walking Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 7, "unicode": "Private Key West History And Culture Southernmost Walking Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 12.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 12.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": 1, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": 1080.0, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 1500, "description": "#Learn the history and culture of Key West!\n\n## Duration\n2 Hours\n\n\n## About\nJoin us for the best walking tour in Key West! \n\nYou will be amazed by how much history and culture our small island has! Local Guide will take you on a time travel adventure. As you stroll through the scenic streets of the Old Town, you will learn how the island was discovered and became one of the richest cities in the USA!\n\nHear the stories of the first industries on the island, such as shipwrecking, sponge harvesting and cigarmaking. Also, learn what key role Key West played in the Cuban fight for its independence and find out why Key West declared the war against the United States. \n\nThe private tour is the best way to explore Key West and have fun with your own group of friends or family!\n\nBook Now and call us to schedule the time that is convenient for you! \n\n*The tour takes place rain or shine - Ponchos will be provided if necessary.*\n\n\n## Walking Distance \nPlease plan to walk approximately 1.4 to 1.8 miles during the tour. \n\n\n## What to Bring\n- Hat, sunglasses, and sunblock are a must.\n- Bring at least one bottle of water for yourself. We will walk and it gets\nhot! \n- Wear comfortable clothing and shoes. Sneakers are the best option.\n- Tour guide gratuity is not included in your ticket. If you had a great\ntime, please tip your guide! It is standard in the service industry to tip\n10-20% of the ticket price.\n- Camera or your phone to take pictures.\n- Your adventurous spirit!", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "# *Please contact our office to schedule the specific time of your tour*\n\nPlease plan to **10 minutes** before the tour's start time! There are no bathrooms along the way, so please make sure to use the restroom before the tour begins. The tour will take place, rain or shine! \n\n**What to Bring**\n\n- Hat, sunglasses and sunblock is a must.\n- Bring at least one bottle of water for yourself. We will walk and it gets hot.\n- Wear comfortable clothing and shoes. Sneakers are the best option.\n- Tour guide gratuity is not included in your ticket. If you had a great\ntime, please tip your guide! It is standard in the service industry to tip\n10-20% the ticket price.\n- Camera or your phone to take pictures.\n- Your adventurous spirit :)", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "2 Hours • All Ages", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridakeysventures/items/196883/imag